lass=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>母亲案发证据被销毁，法医仍坚持可卡因致死说</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">等了22个月的DNA结果换来的是：头发、酒杯、指甲下的DNA从未送检或已被销毁，而法医在两次毒检都显示「干净」的情况下，仍倾向于认定死因是可卡因引发的谵妄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真实犯罪</span><span class=\"tag\">冷案调查</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Berlin Airlift Little Lift Iron Curtain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-historyhit-柏林空运靠的不只是飞机-是把敌人变盟友的心理战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ce644f80fce9ba8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">34:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>柏林空运靠的不只是飞机：是把敌人变盟友的心理战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林切断柏林陆路想困死西方占领区，英美却用一年30万架次空运撑住了城市，顺带把德国人从战败敌人变成了冷战盟友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">柏林空运</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"190: 对话蚂蚁蔡伟：灵光来做「个人Agent」，不是因为它很火 Thread MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-23-latetalk-灵光负责人-个人助理真正的壁垒-是敢替你担责任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/da37f8693b05fa41-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>灵光负责人：个人助理真正的壁垒，是敢替你担责任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蚂蚁灵光把「办事」换成「管事」：好的个人助理应该比你更关心你的事，并主动承担责任，而不只是被动完成任务。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">蚂蚁灵光</span>\n</div