pravlenniia) ES-EVM / Ryad\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-asianometry-苏联版-github-为何失败-3万个程序只有500个能用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db13e18c31d74ac1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">24:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>苏联版 GitHub 为何失败：3万个程序只有500个能用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏联建立了国家算法程序库GosFAP试图解决软件重复造轮子的问题，但缺乏IBM式的硬件兼容标准和市场激励，最终沦为一座存满无用代码的「软件墓地」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">计算机史</span><span class=\"tag\">苏联</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E259｜机械神教与反人性策略：华尔街量化巨头的AI之路 alpha overfitting RSI execution infra alpha capacity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-sv101-量化巨头人均创收2000万美元-却说大模型读不懂市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>量化巨头人均创收2000万美元，却说大模型读不懂市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">XTX Markets靠25000张GPU和200多人创造了全金融业最高的人均利润，但两位量化从业者都认为，通用大模型目前看不懂交易数据，真正的护城河是执行基建，不是模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量化交易</span><span class=\"tag\">高频交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bars Have 90% Margins. Most Still Go Broke. dive bar speakeasy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-modernmba-酒吧毛利近九成仍倒闭过半-花钱买来的理由留不住客人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5d30fe7e35beed3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>酒吧毛利近九成仍倒闭过半：花钱买来的理由留不住客人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">酒吧卖的从来不是酒而是出门喝酒的理由；能用钱买到的理由会被迅速复制失效，撑住酒吧的只有留不住的老板和熟客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">酒吧经济</span><span class=\"tag\">独立零售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"从 DeepSeek 限流到国产芯片困局，中国 AI 还能靠什么追上美国？ harness agentic data CUDA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-cn561550-deepseek-限流不是省钱-是在算力上追不上美国的无奈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3bfa715b8efa75e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">58:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技乱炖</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 限流不是省钱，是在算力上追不上美国的无奈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 对 C 端限流的真实原因不是省钱，而是国产卡在数量和代差上远落后海外头部厂商，模型公司宁可把卡收回去做训练也不愿服务普通用户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">国产芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"First principles: What it takes to be a great product manager in the AI era | Sherif Mansour PM craft triangle artist PM AI builder bolting on AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-lennys-ai时代pm不该写代码-吞吐量不再是瓶颈-方向才是/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9ceda05f276677fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>AI时代PM不该写代码：吞吐量不再是瓶颈，方向才是</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Atlassian把PM、设计师都变成「AI builder」做实验，一个月后团队自己放弃了这种模式——因为AI让产出变快了，但没人知道该往哪划船。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI组织转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Would Anyone Spend $1 Billion on GTA 6? seigniorage payback period Iron Law of mega projects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-patrickboyle-gta6-开发费15亿美元-但预购就已回本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">35:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>GTA6 开发费15亿美元，但预购就已回本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rockstar花13年打磨一款游戏，靠的是GTA Online每年近5亿美元的稳定现金流，而不是急着出续作抢市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">游戏产业</span><span class=\"tag\">企业财务</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Replay: How the Internet Happened | Chris Dixon &amp; Brian McCullough (2018) quality score Web 2.0 low-hanging fruit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-a16z-巨头押注完美宽带-输给了够用就行的糟糕网页/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>巨头押注完美宽带，输给了够用就行的糟糕网页</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼、微软、Comcast 当年押注的是完美的机顶盒式宽带方案，结果败给了足够简陋、却能让极客自己上手写代码的网页技术。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网史</span><span class=\"tag\">商业模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1377: The Brightest Teen Scientists in New Jersey RIG-I TRIM25 K63 ubiquitination HMGB1 MAVS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-twiv-dna病毒的武器竟瞄准rna探测器-还一箭双雕封锁两条免疫通路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>DNA病毒的武器竟瞄准RNA探测器，还一箭双雕封锁两条免疫通路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腺病毒蛋白7本是DNA结合蛋白，却被发现靠劫持TRIM25来压制RNA免疫探测器RIG-I,顺带可能连DNA探测通路也一起封锁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒学</span><span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 504 Finders Keepers: Hugo Grotius on Property Rights state of nature Law of Nations right of necessity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-hopwag-财产权不是上帝赐给亚当的-而是人类后来达成的协议/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">19:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>财产权不是上帝赐给亚当的，而是人类后来达成的协议</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格劳秀斯认为自然状态下人只有使用物品的权利，没有占有的权利，所有权是后来人类协议的产物，而不是上帝分给亚当后代的天赋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自然法</span><span class=\"tag\">财产权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neolithic Revolution lootable resources monopolizable weapons caged land hierarchical hunter-gatherers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-ancients-埃及有法老-新几内亚没有-差别不在农业-而在作物能不能被抢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5dfaa1c7d6f9660-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>埃及有法老，新几内亚没有：差别不在农业，而在作物能不能被抢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新几内亚和埃及几乎同时发明农业，但薯芋类作物长在地下、难以囤积，小麦大麦却能被储存和掠夺——这决定了谁会走向国王与金字塔，谁不会。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">农业起源</span><span class=\"tag\">国家形成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Since last year, we asked: “What if AI solved the Riemann Hypothesis?” Riemann Hypothesis Lean Move 37\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-karpathy-ai若证明黎曼猜想却无人能懂-数学家说这根本不算数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/69b7098cf2c4d5b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>AI若证明黎曼猜想却无人能懂，数学家说这根本不算数</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一场关于「天书证明」的思想实验揭示：证明的价值不在于把真假确定到100%，而在于能否被人理解，这才是数学家真正在乎的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黎曼猜想</span><span class=\"tag\">数学证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 257 - The Rhynie Chert Lagerstätte sinter / geyserite mycorrhizal antheridium trigonotarbid\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-22-thecommondesce-苏格兰一块石头冻住了地球最早的陆地生态系统-连精子射出瞬间都保住了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>苏格兰一块石头冻住了地球最早的陆地生态系统，连精子射出瞬间都保住了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rhynie Chert 是一处4亿1千万年前的热泉硅华沉积，植物、真菌、线虫在矿化瞬间被整体封存，连繁殖细胞释放的那一刻都清晰可见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古植物学</span><span class=\"tag\">真菌共生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1376: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin congenital syphilis Sokova (Zokova) turn wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-21-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-本土持续传播已成常态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>美国正式失去麻疹消除地位：本土持续传播已成常态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泛美卫生组织确认美国本土麻疹已从「输入性散发」变成「本土持续传播」，每周新增病例超200例，而CDC一度拒绝及时公布死亡数据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>"]